    "correct_option": "The UE considers the cell barred and performs cell re-selection to another cell on the same or different frequency, excluding the barred cell for 300 seconds",
    "evidence": "TS 38.331 §5.2.2.4.2 and TS 38.304 §5.3.1: When a cell is indicated as barred (cellBarred='barred'), the UE is not permitted to select/reselect this cell. The UE shall select another cell according to the rule; 'intraFreqReselection' controls whether same-frequency cells are allowed. The barred cell is excluded as a candidate for 300 seconds.",
    "source": "TS 38.331 5.2.2.4.2; TS 38.304 5.3.1"
  },
